            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in Discs 3.5.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Create a local profile with a custom name and photo.</li>
<li>See collection totals, recent albums, and all-time listening favorites.</li>
<li>Include your profile in library backups and follow your preferred shelf style and zoom.</li>
<li>Filter listening history by month, year, or all time.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
