        <item>
            <title>3.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 14:32:43 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/emilianooowo/Discs-Releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s new in Discs 3.3.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Select multiple CDs in All CDs and edit shared details such as tags, locations, edition, and country of origin together.</li>
<li>Open the complete listening history in its own view.</li>
<li>Search listening history by artist, album, or genre with matching results across the page.</li>
<li>Improved navigation stability when opening artist profiles.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
